**table_b GLB blocked:** Tripo3D account credit balance is 0 (`GET /user/balance` → `{"balance": 0, "frozen": 0}`; task creation returns `403 {"code":2010,"message":"You don't have enough credit to create this task"}`). This is an external provider balance, separate from this project's own $/¢ budget tracker in `assets/budget.json` (which still has 348¢ headroom). table_a's GLB apparently consumed the last available credits — its Tripo3D task (`ea61e65e-1ec7-4c76-85db-26cb1078190e`) actually completed successfully server-side even though the client's 300s poll timeout gave up on it first; the GLB was recovered by polling the task_id directly and downloading `output.pbr_model`. No amount of retrying will unblock table_b — the Tripo3D account needs a credit top-up at platform.tripo3d.ai before its GLB can be generated. table_b's ref image is on disk and approved, ready to convert once credits are restored.
